    "`cross_val_score` on the pipeline must agree to every digit; they do. The\n",
    "network is a $1\\to50\\to1$ sigmoid network trained with SGD for 1000 epochs\n",
    "at $\\gamma=0.03$, deliberately *not* tuned — tuning it is your exercise 2."
   ]
